    When your opponent activates a Spell/Trap Card and you control 3 or more "Elvennotes"
    monsters: You can negate that effect, then if you control a Synchro Monster,
    you can destroy that card. You can only use this effect of "Elvennotes ~Oracle
    Alicetea~" once per turn.'
